## The problem

Testing drone behaviour on real hardware is slow, costly and risky. Most full simulators are heavy to set up for quick experiments.

## What I built

A lightweight virtual drone with real physics, built in Godot on top of existing open-source components. It's designed for running specific test scenarios and problems fast.

## Background

I fly both GPS and FPV drones. This project connects that hands-on piloting with systems and software work.

